      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T03:08:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, in this case the function does not really look for a handle as opposed to the real tpm2 library case, Here it is called to initialize the array of reserved objects sizes and addresses, and its prototype matches the one in the real library (where early initialization of the reserved objects stuff also is a side effect of calling this function)",
