      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T02:09:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this assumes that NvEarlyStageFindHandle() is always called before NvGetReserved(). this may change in the future, right?\nif we don\u0027t need anything returned by NvEarlyStageFindHandle(), I\u0027d just turn that function into { return 0; }\nand in NvGetReserved() do \n  if (!initialized) {\n    initialize res_addrs[];\n  }\n  do what it currently does",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 60,
        "endChar": 30
