      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T03:08:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is easy to change how you suggest it and it makes perfect sense in this case, I am just trying to follow the pattern of the real application which is guaranteed to call NvEarlyStageFindHandle() before anything else, to allow all those early NVMEM accesses before TPM2_Startup.\n\nIf you strongly feel that test flow should be different I can do it.",
      "parentUuid": "398851d9_e0dea141",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 60,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "1c2ff656adfbce205fa2c2fe5c3c35fa38ca09a6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
