      "author": {
        "id": 1152319
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T19:11:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just don\u0027t want to rely on NvEarlyStageFindHandle being called first. feels like it always being called first is an arbitrary result of our current impl, not something dictated by the architecture. I\u0027d suggest not to rely on such conditions in tests.",
